  "verseCount": 47,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu akiza umuntu umaze imyaka mirongo itatu n'umunani amugaye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma y'ibyo haba iminsi mikuru y'Abayuda, nuko Yesu ajya i Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi i Yerusalemu bugufi bw'irembo ry'intama hariho ikidendezi, mu Ruheburayo kitwa Betesida, cyariho amabaraza atanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muri ayo mabaraza hari abarwayi benshi, barimo impumyi n'ibirema n'abanyunyutse, [bari bategereje ko amazi yihinduriza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuko rimwe na rimwe marayika yamanukaga akajya muri icyo kidendezi, agahinduriza amazi. Nuko umuntu wabanzaga kujyamo amazi yihindurije, ni we wakiraga indwara ye iyo ari yo yose.]",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hariho umuntu wari ufite indwara, ayimaranye imyaka mirongo itatu n'umunani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu amubonye aryamye amenya yuko amaze igihe kirekire arwaye, aramubaza ati “Mbese urashaka gukira?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umurwayi aramusubiza ati “Databuja, simfite umuntu unjugunya mu kidendezi iyo amazi yihindurije, nkīza undi antanga kumanukamo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu aramubwira ati “Byuka wikorere uburiri bwawe ugende.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muri ako kanya uwo muntu arakira, yikorera uburiri bwe aragenda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubwo hari ku munsi w'isabato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.13.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 13.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.17.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 17.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nuko Abayuda babwira ukijijwe bati “Dore uyu munsi ni isabato, kandi amategeko ntiyemera ko wikorera uburiri bwawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na we arabasubiza ati “Uwankijije ni we wambwiye ati ‘Ikorere uburiri bwawe ugende.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baramubaza bati “Uwo muntu ni nde wakubwiye ngo wikorere ugende?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko uwakijijwe ntiyamenya uwo ari we, kuko Yesu yari yigendeye kandi hari abantu benshi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma y'ibyo Yesu amubona mu rusengero aramubwira ati “Dore ubaye muzima, ntukongere gukora icyaha utazabona ishyano riruta irya mbere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo muntu aragenda abwira Abayuda yuko ari Yesu wamukijije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni cyo cyatumaga Abayuda bashaka kurenganya Yesu, kuko yakoraga bene nk'ibyo ku isabato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko arabasubiza ati “Data arakora kugeza n'ubu, nanjye ndakora.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni cyo cyatumye Abayuda barushaho gushaka kumwica, kuko uretse kuzirura isabato gusa, ahubwo ahora yita n'Imana ko ari Se bwite, akīgereranya na yo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ahamya ko ubutware bwe buva ku Mana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu arabasubiza ati “Ni ukuri, ni ukuri, ndababwira yuko ari nta cyo Umwana abasha gukora ubwe atabonye Se agikora, kuko ibyo Se akora byose n'Umwana ari byo akora, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuko Se akunda Umwana we akamwereka ibyo akora byose, ndetse azamwereka n'imirimo iruta iyi kugira ngo mutangare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nk'uko Se azura abapfuye akabaha ubugingo, ni ko n'Umwana aha ubugingo abo ashaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko ari nta n'umwe Data aciraho iteka, ahubwo yabihaye Umwana ngo abe ari we uca amateka yose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kugira ngo abantu bose bubahe Umwana nk'uko bubaha Se. Utubaha uwo Mwana ntaba yubashye na Se wamutumye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ni ukuri, ni ukuri, ndababwira yuko uwumva ijambo ryanjye akizera uwantumye, aba afite ubugingo buhoraho kandi ntazacirwaho iteka, ahubwo aba avuye mu rupfu ageze mu bugingo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ukuri, ni ukuri, ndababwira yuko igihe kije ndetse kirasohoye, ubwo abapfa bumva kandi bazumva ijwi ry'Umwana w'Imana, n'abaryumvise bazaba bazima, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuko nk'uko Data afite ubugingo muri we, ni ko yabuhaye Umwana ngo abugire na we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi yamuhaye ubutware bwo guca amateka, kuko ari Umwana w'umuntu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntimutangazwe n'ibyo kuko igihe kizaza, ubwo abari mu bituro bose bazumva ijwi rye ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.12.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 12.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " bakavamo, abakoze ibyiza bakazukira ubugingo, naho abakoze ibibi bakazukira gucirwaho iteka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ibihamya Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nta cyo mbasha gukora ubwanjye, ahubwo uko numvise ni ko nca amateka, kandi ayo nca ni ay'ukuri kuko ntakurikiza ibyo nkunda ubwanjye, ahubwo nkurikiza ibyo uwantumye akunda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nakwihamya ubwanjye, guhamya kwanjye ntikuba ari uk'ukuri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ahubwo hariho undi umpamya, nanjye nzi yuko ibyo ampamya ari iby'ukuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.1.19+JHN.1.20+JHN.1.21+JHN.1.22+JHN.1.23+JHN.1.24+JHN.1.25+JHN.1.26+JHN.1.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 1.19-27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.3.27+JHN.3.28+JHN.3.29+JHN.3.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "3.27-30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mwatumye kuri Yohana, na we yahamije ukuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icyakora sinishingikirije ku buhamya bw'umuntu, ahubwo mbivugiye kugira ngo mukizwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo yari itabaza ryaka rimurika, namwe mwamaze igihe gito mwishimira umucyo we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko mfite ibimpamya biruta ibya Yohana, kuko imirimo Data yampaye ngo nyisohoze, iyo mirimo nkora ari yo impamya ubwayo yuko Data ari we wantumye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.3.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 3.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.1.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 1.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.3.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 3.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi Data wantumye na we yahamije ibyanjye ubwe. Ntimwigeze kumva ijwi rye, habe no kubona ishusho ye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ndetse ntimufite n'ijambo rye riguma muri mwe, kuko uwo yatumye mutamwizeye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Murondora mu byanditswe, kuko mwibwira ko muri byo arimo mufite ubugingo buhoraho, kandi ari byo bimpamya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyamara mwanze kuza aho ndi, ngo muhabwe ubugingo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Sinshaka ishimwe ry'abantu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ariko mwebwe ndabazi yuko mudakunda Imana mu mitima yanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jye naje mu izina rya Data ntimwanyemera, ariko undi naza mu izina rye ubwe we muzamwemera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbese mwabasha mute kwizera kandi mumaranira gushimwa n'abantu, mu cyimbo cyo gushaka ishimwe riva ku Mana ubwayo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwe gutekereza yuko nzabarega kuri Data kuko hariho ubarega, ndetse ni Mose uwo mwiringiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo mwizera Mose nanjye muba munyizeye, kuko ari ibyanjye yanditse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 5:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko se nimutizera ibyo uwo yanditse, noneho n'amagambo yanjye muzayizera mute?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.5.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.5.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
